{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_document", "label": "SDD Plan-Scoped Workspace Design (spec)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_plan_scoped_workspace", "label": "Plan-Scoped SDD Workspace", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Identity must be structural: any fix relying on end-of-plan cleanup alone fails exactly in the crash/compaction cases the ledger exists to survive; .superpowers/sdd/<plan-slug>/ makes cross-plan collision impossible and stale siblings inert."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_sdd_workspace_script", "label": "sdd-workspace Script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolves and creates the plan's workspace directory; maintains the self-ignoring parent .gitignore; errors on missing argument or nonexistent plan file."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_task_brief_script", "label": "task-brief Script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Signature unchanged; the default OUTFILE moves into the plan's workspace via sdd-workspace, so briefs from different plans can never overwrite each other."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_review_package_script", "label": "review-package Script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gains PLAN_FILE as first argument; diff packages land under the plan's workspace with unique SHA-range collateral names (worktree/submodule-safe)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_ledger_identity_line", "label": "Ledger Plan-Identity First Line", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Belt for hand-rolled ledgers: a first line naming the plan makes foreign ledgers detectable without forensics - a ledger naming a different plan is another plan's progress, left in place."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_workspace_end_of_life", "label": "Workspace End-of-Life Cleanup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hygiene, not correctness: after the final review's fix wave merges, the controller deletes its plan's workspace - the record of work is git history; sibling directories and parked cross-plan artifacts are never touched."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_document", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_06_sdd_plan_scoped_workspace_plan_scoped_workspace", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-06-sdd-plan-scoped-workspace.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_20